  "story": {
   "title": "农场里最棒的一天",
   "en": "Every summer, Sam's dad drove the old van to his uncle's farm. Sam loved the trip. He always brought a small bag with a blue hat, a red pen, and a map of the farm in his pocket.\n\nThe farm was big and full of life. There was a fat pink pig sleeping in the mud, a brown dog named Bud, and a speckled hen that ran across the path. Sam's favorite was a little pup who loved to jump and run. Every time Sam sat down, the pup would come and lick his hand, and Sam would laugh.\n\nIn the afternoon, Sam and his dad walked to the barn. A kind man gave them a cold cup of water. Sam saw a box of big red apples and a jug of sweet jam. He was so hot that he drank the water very fast. \"This is fun,\" he said, and his dad smiled.\n\nThen it began to rain. Sam put on his hat and ran to a small hut. His dad followed with a soft rug. They sat together and watched the rain fall. A green frog sat on a wet log near the door, and a tiny bug crawled through the grass.\n\nWhen the rain stopped, the sun came out. Sam helped his dad fix a broken gate. He got a bit of mud on his lip, and his dad laughed. \"You look funny,\" his dad said, and they both grinned.\n\nOn the way home, Sam fell asleep in the van. His dad put a warm rug over him. Sam dreamed of the pig, the pup, and the frog on the log. It was, he thought, the very best day of the whole summer.",
   "zh": "每年夏天，山姆的爸爸都会开着那辆旧货车去叔叔的农场。山姆喜欢这趟旅程。他总会带上一个小包，里面装着一顶蓝帽子、一支红笔，口袋里还放着一张农场地图。\n\n农场很大，充满了生气。一头胖胖的粉红小猪睡在泥里，一只叫巴德的棕狗跑来跑去，还有一只花母鸡穿过小路。山姆最喜欢的是一只爱蹦爱跑的小狗。每次山姆坐下，小狗就会过来舔他的手，逗得山姆哈哈大笑。\n\n下午，山姆和爸爸走向谷仓。一位好心人递给他们一杯凉水。山姆看见一箱又大又红的苹果和一罐甜甜的果酱。他热坏了，飞快地把水喝光。\"真好玩，\"他说，爸爸笑了。\n\n后来下起了雨。山姆戴上帽子，跑进一间小棚屋。爸爸拿着一块柔软的地毯跟了上来。他们坐在一起看雨。一只绿青蛙蹲在门边的湿木头上，一只小虫在草里爬来爬去。\n\n雨停后，太阳出来了。山姆帮爸爸修好了一扇坏掉的门。他的嘴唇上沾了点泥，爸爸笑了起来。\"你看起来真滑稽，\"爸爸说，两个人都咧嘴笑了。\n\n回家的路上，山姆在货车里睡着了。爸爸把温暖的毯子盖在他身上。山姆梦见了小猪、小狗和木头上的青蛙。他想，这是整个夏天最棒的一天。"
  }
 },
