  "story": {
   "title": "湖边的一天",
   "en": "On a warm summer day, our family rode our bikes to the big blue lake. I could hardly wait to get there. My little sister, whose name is Rose, sat on the back of Dad's bike. She held a red kite and a ball of white string, and she could not sit still.\n\nThe lake was wide and quiet. We saw a small white boat move slowly across the water and a tall green tree by the shore. A yellow bee flew past us, and somewhere a gray goat was eating grass. \"I like it here,\" Rose said, with a big smile on her face.\n\nWe spread a blanket on the grass and ate the food Mom had made. There was fresh bread, a round apple pie, and a cake with five little candles. I took a bite of the pie and closed my eyes. It tasted like home. Mom laughed and said we could take a piece home for Grandma.\n\nDad taught Rose how to fly the kite. He held the rope and she ran as fast as she could. Up, up went the kite, high above the tree, until it was only a tiny dot against the blue sky. \"Make it go higher!\" she cried, and Dad laughed.\n\nIn the evening, we rode home along the quiet road. The sky turned soft pink, and the first bright star appeared. Rose dozed off on the back of Dad's bike, still holding the kite string. Mom gently put her coat over her.\n\nThat night, before I went to sleep, I looked out of my window at the moon. I thought of the lake, the little boat, and my sister's laugh. Some days are small and simple, but they stay with you forever.",
   "zh": "一个温暖的夏日，我们一家人骑着自行车来到那片又大又蓝的湖边。我迫不及待想快点到达。我的小妹妹叫罗丝，坐在爸爸自行车的后座上。她手里拿着一只红风筝和一团白线，怎么也安静不下来。\n\n湖面又宽又静。我们看见一艘小白船在水面上缓缓移动，岸边立着一棵高高的绿树。一只黄蜜蜂从我们身边飞过，远处有只灰山羊正在吃草。\"我喜欢这里，\"罗丝说，脸上绽放着大大的笑容。\n\n我们在草地上铺开毯子，吃着妈妈做的食物。有新鲜的面包、圆圆的苹果派，还有一个插着五支小蜡烛的蛋糕。我咬了一口派，闭上了眼睛。那味道就像家的味道。妈妈笑着说，我们可以带一块回家给奶奶。\n\n爸爸教罗丝放风筝。他握着线，她拼命地跑。风筝越飞越高，高过树梢，最后变成了蓝天上的一个小点。\"再飞高一点！\"她喊道，爸爸笑出了声。\n\n傍晚，我们沿着安静的小路骑车回家。天空变成了柔和的粉色，第一颗明亮的星星出现了。罗丝在爸爸的自行车后座上打起了瞌睡，手里还攥着风筝线。妈妈轻轻把外套盖在她身上。\n\n那天晚上睡觉前，我望着窗外的月亮。我想起了那片湖、那只小船和妹妹的笑声。有些日子平凡又简单，却会永远留在心里。"
  }
 },
