  "story": {
   "title": "山坡上的花园",
   "en": "My friend Lily lives in a small white house at the end of a quiet street. Behind her house there is a garden, and in the middle of the garden there is an old apple tree. Every spring, the tree is full of white flowers, and the green grass is soft under your feet. It was the place where we felt most at home.\n\nLily and I spent many long afternoons in that garden. We would sit on a flat stone and draw pictures in an old book. Lily drew a blue bird, and I drew a pink flower. Sometimes a tiny snail crawled past us, moving so slowly that we had to stop and wait for it. We knew every stone and every corner of that little garden, and we were never in a hurry.\n\nOne day, we found a little green frog under a stone. It looked afraid, so Lily put it in a glass jar with some clean water and a leaf. We watched it swim for a while, and then we let it go back to the grass. \"It is happier there,\" Lily said with a warm smile. She laughed, and her eyes shone in the soft afternoon light.\n\nLily's grandmother often brought us lunch on a tray: fresh brown bread, white cheese, sweet purple grapes, and a glass of cold milk. We ate slowly, talking about everything and nothing at all. After lunch, she would sit in her chair and tell us gentle stories about when she was a young girl.\n\nI still think of that garden sometimes. The old clock in the kitchen always seemed to stop when we were playing. I wish every afternoon could be so gentle. Those days were simple, but they were full of warmth and light.",
   "zh": "我的朋友莉莉住在一条安静街道尽头的一座白色小房子里。房子后面有个花园，花园中央有一棵老苹果树。每年春天，树上开满白色的花，绿油油的草地踩上去软软的。那是我们最自在的地方。\n\n我和莉莉在那个花园里度过了许多漫长的午后。我们会坐在一块平坦的石头上，在一本旧书里画画。莉莉画了一只蓝鸟，我画了一朵粉色的花。有时一只小蜗牛从我们身边爬过，爬得那么慢，我们不得不停下来等它。我们熟悉那个小花园里的每一块石头和每一个角落，却从不觉得厌烦。\n\n有一天，我们在一块石头下发现了一只绿色的小青蛙。它看上去很害怕，于是莉莉把它放进一个玻璃罐，加了些干净的水和一片叶子。我们看着它游了一会儿，然后把它放回草地。\"它在那里会更快乐，\"莉莉带着温暖的笑容说。她笑了起来，眼睛在柔和的午后阳光里闪闪发亮。\n\n莉莉的奶奶常常用托盘给我们送来午饭：新鲜的全麦面包、白奶酪、甜甜的紫葡萄，还有一杯凉牛奶。我们慢慢地吃着，聊着天，无所不谈，也漫无边际。午饭后，她会坐在椅子上，给我们讲她小时候的温馨故事。\n\n我有时还会想起那个花园。我们玩耍时，厨房里的老钟似乎总是停了下来。我希望每个午后都能这样温柔。那些日子很简单，却充满了温暖和光亮。"
  }
 },
