  "story": {
   "title": "农场小屋的秋天",
   "en": "Every autumn, my teacher took our class to visit kind Aunt May at her farm. We rode there in an old yellow car, and I sat by the window with a book on my lap. I had waited for this trip all month. I looked out at the fields and saw tall green corn and a brown horse standing in the warm sun.\n\nAunt May was a nurse in the town, but on weekends she loved to cook at the farm. She was a gentle woman with kind hands and a loud, happy laugh. She gave each of us a fork and a plate, and we ate fresh bread and butter under the big tree. The smell of fresh bread filled the cool autumn air. Everything tasted better outside.\n\nThere was a small boy named Tom who lived nearby. He had a toy horse and a pet mouse. He showed us a bird's nest high in the tree and a silver coin he had found in the park. \"It brings good luck,\" he said, holding it carefully in his small hand. We all wanted to see the nest, but we were careful not to disturb it.\n\nBefore we left, we walked slowly down to the old barn. A spotted cow looked at us from the gate, and a little girl was drawing flowers in the soft dirt with a stick. The sun was going down, and the sky turned orange and gold. It was the kind of place you never wanted to leave.\n\nThat night, I saw the first bright star through my bedroom window. I thought of the horse, the tall corn, and Aunt May's warm kitchen. Autumn, I decided, was my favorite season, not because of the cold wind, but because of days like this one.",
   "zh": "每年秋天，老师都会带我们班去农场探望和蔼的梅阿姨。我们坐着一辆黄色的旧车来到那里，我坐在窗边，腿上放着一本书。这趟旅行我已经盼了整整一个月。我望着窗外的田野，看见高高的绿玉米，还有一匹棕色的马站在温暖的阳光里。\n\n梅阿姨是镇上的护士，但周末她喜欢在农场里做饭。她是位温柔的女士，双手温暖，笑声爽朗。她给我们每人一把叉子和一个盘子，我们在大树下吃着新鲜的面包和黄油。面包香弥漫在凉爽的秋日空气里。在户外，什么东西尝起来都更美味。\n\n附近住着一个小男孩，叫汤姆。他有一匹玩具马和一只宠物老鼠。他给我们看树高处的一个鸟窝，还有他在公园里捡到的一枚银币。\"它会带来好运，\"他说，小心地把它攥在小手里。我们都想看看那个鸟窝，却又小心翼翼，不去打扰它。\n\n离开前，我们慢慢走向老谷仓。一头带斑点的牛从门口望着我们，一个小女孩正用树枝在松软的泥土上画花。太阳渐渐落下，天空变成了橙金色。那是一个让人舍不得离开的地方。\n\n那天夜里，我透过卧室的窗户看见了第一颗明亮的星星。我想起了那匹马、高高的玉米，还有梅阿姨温暖的厨房。我想，秋天是我最爱的季节——不是因为寒冷的风，而是因为这样的一天。"
  }
